  "definition": "IDP Duration",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-03-19",
  "historyNote": "#2707, eff 5-15-84, EXPIRED: 5-15-90 New. #4845, eff 6-20-90, EXPIRED: 6-20-96 New. #6304, eff 7-26-96; ss by #8124, INTERIM, eff 7-26-04, EXPIRES: 1-22-05; ss by #8235, eff 12-22-04 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1200) (formerly Env-Ws 1205.04); ss by #9798-A, eff 10-9-10); ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
